---
title: CI/CD pipeline (.github/workflows/ci.yml)
---
flowchart LR
  dev[Developer push / PR] --> j1[java-build-test<br/>unit tests + package jars]
  dev --> j3[frontend<br/>lint, unit tests, build]
  dev --> sec
  subgraph sec[Security and quality gates in parallel]
    cq[CodeQL] --- sg[Semgrep] --- ds[Trivy fs + npm audit] --- sc[gitleaks]
  end
  j1 --> j2[java-integration<br/>failsafe, Testcontainers when Docker present]
  dev --> iv[infra-validate<br/>kustomize build, kubeconform,<br/>terraform validate, compose config]
  j1 --> dk[docker<br/>build images, Trivy image scan]
  j3 --> dkui[docker-ui]
  dk --> push[Push to GHCR<br/>main and tags only]
  dkui --> push
  j1 --> smoke[smoke-local<br/>embedded Kafka stack + smoke test]
  push --> dt[deploy-test<br/>placeholder: needs kubeconfig secret]
  dt --> st[Smoke test on test environment]
  st -.manual approval, rollout undo.-> prod[Prod overlay deploy: documented, not automated here]
